    "detailed_description": "Can you find all the bugs?<br>A spot-the-difference action game compatible with VRM!<br>\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f<br>A village where people live peacefully<br>It was supposed to be, but before I knew it, it was full of bugs! ?<br><br>Villagers' actions, conversations, appearance, etc.<br>There are changes in various places!<br><br>Find out what happened to the village<br>Let's get back to the original state!<br>\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f<br>[Genre]<br>exploration action game<br><br>[Game content]<br>Many villagers live in the village.<br>There are 5 bugs hidden in it.<br>His head is getting bigger and his arms are getting longer.<br>The conversational sentences are strange, and the actions are strange.<br>Explore the village and find 5 hidden bugs<br>Let's get things back to normal!<br>The game is cleared when you find them all.<br>There are 35 types of bugs in total, and they change every time you start the game.<br><br>[VRM compatible]<br>You can play with your own avatar<br><br>play time<br>1 play: around 5 minutes (1 play has 5 bugs)<br>Until ED: around 30 minutes",
    "about_the_game": "Can you find all the bugs?<br>A spot-the-difference action game compatible with VRM!<br>\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f<br>A village where people live peacefully<br>It was supposed to be, but before I knew it, it was full of bugs! ?<br><br>Villagers' actions, conversations, appearance, etc.<br>There are changes in various places!<br><br>Find out what happened to the village<br>Let's get back to the original state!<br>\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f\uff3f<br>[Genre]<br>exploration action game<br><br>[Game content]<br>Many villagers live in the village.<br>There are 5 bugs hidden in it.<br>His head is getting bigger and his arms are getting longer.<br>The conversational sentences are strange, and the actions are strange.<br>Explore the village and find 5 hidden bugs<br>Let's get things back to normal!<br>The game is cleared when you find them all.<br>There are 35 types of bugs in total, and they change every time you start the game.<br><br>[VRM compatible]<br>You can play with your own avatar<br><br>play time<br>1 play: around 5 minutes (1 play has 5 bugs)<br>Until ED: around 30 minutes",
